---
layout: layout.njk
---

<div class="bg-base-100 text-base-content min-h-screen">
  <!-- ABOUT NICOLAS -->
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-3xl items-center gap-12 px-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="order-2 space-y-5 md:order-1">
        <h1>Hi, I'm Nicolas</h1>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed opacity-90">
          I've spent 15 years working with teams and organizations. The most
          important work happens in the space between strategy and execution—in
          the tensions and misalignments that don't fit into project tickets.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed opacity-90">
          I've helped leadership teams through mergers, transformations, and
          culture shifts. I've learned that clarity comes from questions, not
          answers.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed opacity-90">
          Organifanten is my attempt to make this approach accessible.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="order-1 flex justify-center md:order-2 md:justify-end">
        <img
          src="/assets/images/NicolasMegow.jpg"
          alt="Nicolas Megow"
          class="w-72 rounded-3xl object-cover shadow-sm md:w-80"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
      <h3 class="my-8 text-center">Selected clients</h3>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-8">
        <img
          src="/assets/images/references/Ref_Cargoline.png"
          alt="Cargoline"
          class="h-10 w-auto"
        />
        <img
          src="/assets/images/references/Ref_Oetker.png"
          alt="Oetker"
          class="h-10 w-auto"
        />
        <img
          src="/assets/images/references/Ref_Mediaprint.png"
          alt="Mediaprint"
          class="h-10 w-auto"
        />
        <img
          src="/assets/images/references/Ref_Studyhelp.png"
          alt="Studyhelp"
          class="h-10 w-auto"
        />
        <img
          src="/assets/images/references/Ref_OEDIV.png"
          alt="OEDIV"
          class="h-10 w-auto"
        />
        <img
          src="/assets/images/references/Ref_Mettenmeier.png"
          alt="Mettenmeier"
          class="h-10 w-auto"
        />
        <img
          src="/assets/images/references/Ref_Padersprinter.png"
          alt="Padersprinter"
          class="h-10 w-auto"
        />
        <img
          src="/assets/images/references/Ref_Quanto.png"
          alt="Quanto"
          class="h-10 w-auto"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HOW I WORK -->
  <section class="bg-accent py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-3xl font-semibold">How I work</h2>
      <p class="mb-10 text-lg opacity-80">
        My approach is guided by three principles:
      </p>
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="text-primary mt-1 w-8 shrink-0 text-xl">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-brain"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="mb-1 font-semibold">Brain Budget</h3>
            <p class="opacity-80">
              People have limited attention and cognitive capacity. Most
              dysfunction makes sense once you see it as energy efficiency in
              disguise.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="text-primary mt-1 w-8 shrink-0 text-xl">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-minus"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="mb-1 font-semibold">Via Negativa</h3>
            <p class="opacity-80">
              Removing obstacles is often more effective than adding solutions.
              Subtract before you add.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="text-primary mt-1 w-8 shrink-0 text-xl">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-question"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="mb-1 font-semibold">Humble Consulting</h3>
            <p class="opacity-80">
              Sustainable change comes from understanding together, not
              prescribing from the outside.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <!-- PROOF -->
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
      <blockquote class="border-primary mt-8 border-l-4 pl-4">
        <p>
          The intensive support and active steering of the process were
          outstanding and played a key role in ensuring its success.
        </p>
        <footer class="mt-2 italic opacity-60">Günter R. (Commercial Director)</footer>
      </blockquote>
      <blockquote class="border-primary mt-8 border-l-4 pl-4">
        <p>
          Effective tools and methods are used to achieve excellent results in a
          remarkably short amount of time.
        </p>
        <footer class="mt-2 italic opacity-60">Andreas H. (Managing Director)</footer>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- OFFERS -->
  <section class="bg-accent py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
      <h2>Ways to work together</h2>
      <p>Depending on where you are and what you need.</p>

      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div>
          <h3>
            <a href="/consulting/session/" class="text-primary hover:underline"
              >Consulting Session</a
            >
          </h3>
          <p class="mb-1 opacity-80">
            90-minute thinking partnership. You bring a real situation; I ask
            questions until your next step becomes visible.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3>
            <a
              href="/consulting/change-audit/"
              class="text-primary hover:underline"
              >Change Audit</a
            >
          </h3>
          <p class="mb-1 opacity-80">
            1-week diagnostic. 10 interviews, materials review, findings
            document, and debrief. Use when a specific change is underway.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3>
            <a
              href="/consulting/culture-portrait/"
              class="text-primary hover:underline"
              >Culture Portrait</a
            >
          </h3>
          <p class="mb-1 opacity-80">
            1-week characterization of your organizational culture. 3-page
            portrait and debrief. Use before any change is designed.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% include "footer.njk" %}
</div>
